codex
The measurement will use all four `V025_PROBE_R2` worlds and their 30 decision anchors (120 anchors if runtime holds). I’m fixing the candidate rules before opening outcomes: nearest eligible arrivals for occupancy activation; top-2 and top-3 interferers only for interference-limited victims not rescued by top-1; and full evacuation of occupancy-2/3 beams. “Best alternative” is the highest full-step objective among that already-identified user’s legal unilateral alternatives; candidate users themselves are never ranked by `|d_i|`.
